Server Track

The Server Training Track has been especially designed with you in mind!
The Track will have a technical focus of special interest to System
Managers, IT designers, consultants, and intermediate to advanced technical
professionals.  The sessions will allow attendees to hear DIGITAL's
technical experts present "real-world" server-based IT solutions using the
latest "How-to" information.  The practical knowledge attendees will gain
will enhance Customers' present and future investments in DIGITAL's server
systems.

The sessions in the Server Track will examine issues concerned with
strategically installing and managing large server sites; using the correct
tools to take the "mystery" out of cluster tuning and installation; how to
configure servers for maximum reliability; learn to effectively use
StorageWORKS Management and how to deploy a multiple operating system
strategy in your enterprise.  There will also be sessions to teach attendees
how to maximize the capability of your Super NT, DIGITAL OpenVMS, and
DIGITAL UNIX AlphaServers; the effective care and management of Database
Servers - especially in a mixed environment; how to prep your site for
DIGITAL's EV6-based Server Technology, and a special session designed to
allow you to get acquainted with ServerWORKS Management.  Additionally,
there is a session to help attendees to become familiar with a wide range of
high performance upgrades and add-ons available for DIGTAL's Alpha and
VAX-based server systems.

Other supporting workshops and hands-on training sessions will make this a
memorable, educational, and rewarding event for all attendees!






