Internet Track

AltaVista Internet sessions will provide the latest technical information
needed to effectively implement enterprise quality solutions utilizing
AltaVista security and search products.  These sessions will address
Digital's full range of security solutions based on current AltaVista tunnel
and firewall products as well as details on future security products and in
depth discussions of how to effectively utilize search and indexing
technologies in the deploying enterprise Intranets.

OpenVMS Internet sessions will focus on how to web-enable OpenVMS data and
how to build an OpenVMS web server using Netscape FastTrack, as well as in
OpenVMS Internet Update.

Digital's UNIX engineers will be showing you how to install and tune the
Netscape FastTrack server, as well as discussing other Internet-based
solutions.








