Storage Track

This  Track will provide storage managers, IT planners and technical
practitioners with technical information, strategy and solutions for
maximizing storage investments in their environments.

The sessions will focus on future storage technologies and paradigms, as
well as on real-life implementation and deployment issues.

The sessions will specifically address issues such as networked storage
strategies, and the benefits of Ultra SCSI and Fibre Channel technologies in
the storage enterprise. Participants will be able to learn how to easily
configure their overall storage environment.  In addition, a session will
address a simpler way to configure their storage clusters using SCSI Hubs
(OVMS, UNIX, and NT).   They will also learn how to plan for growth and
optimize performance in their storage. In addition, there will  be sessions
on developing a backup strategy for multivendor environments, and planning
for disaster tolerance.








