Enterprise Software Track
Web-enabling and Integrating Commercial Applications with NT

This track provides intermediate and advanced system developers and
administrators with the tools and information they need to "open" commercial
applications to web access and interfaces.  The track also covers in detail
how to either integrate or migrate applications and application development
to the NT operating system.

Sessions and workshops will draw on the expertise of DIGITAL's engineering
development teams as well as customers to provide detailed solutions for
maximizing your investment in OpenVMS, UNIX and NT-based applications.
Sessions will also cover new NT software which bring added value to the NT
operating system and to key NT applications such as the Microsoft Exchange
mail server.

Attendees will learn how to web-enable their applications so those users can
have state-of-the-art access to all types of applications, regardless of on
which operating system the application resides.  They will also learn how to
easily develop and manage cross-platform applications for transaction
processing, enterprise mail and document management solutions.






